  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth Take the Lead:The project focusses on enhancing youth leadership across the two country Hubs (Nepal, Tanzania and Colombia) to productively engage in community development and to promote global citizenship. The main purpose of the project is to provide a platform for national youths to enhance their leadership and create positive impact within the organisations and in their communities (i.e. youth engagement).</narrative>
